### `TransactionService.java`

Implemented:

* Idempotency-key validation
* Maximum key length of 100 characters
* SHA-256 request hashing
* Existing-transaction lookup
* Same-request replay handling
* Different-request conflict detection
* Database concurrency handling
* No repeated Account Service call for successful replays

